  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When a lightning lycan activates Wolf Smoke Gu, the resulting black mist spreads at a speed faster than the eye can see, completely covering over a hundred li of radius in a short moment.",
        "chapters": [
          168
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Wolf Smoke Gu is one of the healing Gu that are not intended for human bodies. Some Gu like wolf smoke Gu are specifically used to treat the injuries of wolves, while other Gu like pig iron Gu are used to treat the Chainsaw Golden Centipede.",
        "chapters": [
          431
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_healing_gu",
          "gu_pig_iron_gu",
          "gu_chainsaw_golden_centipede"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan activates Wolf Smoke Gu after subduing a hump wolf, it flies out and turns into thick smoke that engulfs both the hump wolf and most of the injured poison beard wolves. In a moment the thick smoke disperses, and the hump wolf’s injuries are fully healed with new fur grown. The injured poison beard wolves regain their vitality.",
        "chapters": [
          436
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "healing-wolves",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan activates Wolf Smoke Gu to heal a large group of wolves all at once on his ranch. This rank four healing Gu which is especially used to heal the injuries on wolves produces surging smoke that envelops the whole ranch for a long time. The primeval essence consumption to heal so many wolves at once is very huge, rapidly lowering Fang Yuan’s primeval sea to the bottom. With the sea at the bottom Fang Yuan recovers using primeval stones, and after three rounds of healing the wolves’ heavy injuries have become light ones while the light injuries are gone.",
        "chapters": [
          453
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "multiple-wounds",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
